<div class="mandarin-pinyin">yǎnjìng</div>

''Meaning:'' glasses; spectacles  
''Part of speech:'' noun

!! In context
我戴眼镜看地图。 — Wǒ dài yǎnjìng kàn dìtú. — I wear glasses to look at the map.

!! Usage note
Do not confuse with 眼睛 yǎnjing “eyes.”
